</div>

<!-- 図5 -->
<div class="view diagram" id="v5">
  <button class="back" data-back><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>一覧へ</button>
  <div class="dtitle">発展：この曲線、どちらに動く？</div>
  <div class="qpair5">
    <div class="qbox5">
      <div class="ic">👶</div>
      <div class="qb">胎児のヘモグロビンは、<br>母体のものと比べて曲線がどちらに動く？</div>
